<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6470] Wrong casting of long value to int leads to incorrect results</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6470</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Wrong casting of &lt;tt&gt;long&lt;/tt&gt; value to &lt;tt&gt;int&lt;/tt&gt; leads to incorrect results:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;/** {@inheritDoc} */&lt;/span&gt;
    @Override &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; pages() {
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (!inited)
            &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; 0;
        
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;// allocated.get() returns &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;long&lt;/span&gt; value. We should &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;cast&lt;/span&gt; it to &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; after division.
&lt;/span&gt;        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;)((allocated.get() - headerSize()) / pageSize);
    }

&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
